{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：10:40 2026-06-16 HKT</p>\n\n<p>《2026香港小姐競選》今日安排入圍佳麗到金鐘一所髮廊進行髮型改造，曝光11位入圍佳麗名單，分別是大熱的李澤欣與吳倬希，以及袁絲珩、李澄晴、盧蔚晴、譚雅文、湯家琳、顏懿菲、楊媛媛、鄧匡閔、周芳姿，今次入圍佳麗同樣身材較纖瘦，大多已掌握流利廣東話，之前被影到有紋身、身型有待改善，或有「後天加工」疑慮的參賽者，都未有入選。</p>\n<p>李澤欣頭戴Cap帽第一位抵達，問到可擔心變髮？她笑言已開會討論過，不擔心變「大媽」，又表示順利入圍很開心，仍在適應選美生活。而姊妹花參選，只剩由悉尼返港參選的妹妹盧蔚晴順利入選，問家姐是否落選？她未有回答，僅禮貌微笑。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5776887ff7b245682f4a87fca82cb588/2026-06/A1_0_7.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c3b8e8fca284a1aafbde25207ba6c91/2026-06/A2_14.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/269444b6a4ca0eeb1344a5fa60b60a3b/2026-06/A3_0_6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70dfccdad4d4b18d2aaf2acfc13c3867/2026-06/A4_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0dfaac1f7f847f4a997e76c52b8fc7f3/2026-06/A5_4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bda897f3dbfcbe06da60e2dcd02dec77/2026-06/A6_4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1b4cfc17273e0c91af81b8c8174768c/2026-06/A7_2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d332d8201775ee7c18599919703d305f/2026-06/A8_2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/833a27cb55d0baa8a4fe46da2c7f386f/2026-06/A9_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e0d13076ace0a20f86ecbcae12cee7e/2026-06/A10_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a5a0c7684a8344cc0af4fd33cd8c40e/2026-06/A11_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39f15391808ea4d080fca7475802d497/2026-06/A12_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13c3028ecc9bcf569c32648b3eb2f3b6/2026-06/A13_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57b0d3a0023a5af1a15795bea62e3316/2026-06/A14_1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f865d7b8a46210802a17afe85526d427/2026-06/A15_0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-16T03:02:19.273924+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}